      "value": "I didn't think of this initially:\n\nRight now it can be abused to bypass \"streamer mode\" to show avatar thumbnails on screen to streamers.\n\nThis needs an update asap to at least be hidden in streamer mode.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/groups/p/streamer-mode-exposing-private-groups",
