  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-11T08:36:36.452Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now if you run a public group you will get spammed with notifications for new members requesting to join. \n\nThis is can be very distracting when roleplaying or streaming. \n\nI suggest adding:\n\n- Muting group notifications option. This way you only see them when you open the menu in your own time. \n\n- Streamer mode automatically mutes group notifications.\n\nCheers. Keep up the great work!",
